The project file does not show any InternalsVisibleTo attribute to allow test projects to access internal types. The class ReseedFolderFlag is internal, so I cannot directly instantiate or call its methods from a test project.

I will try to write tests for the ILogger extension method call by mocking the ILogger interface and calling the PerformAsync method via reflection, bypassing the internal access restriction. I will also mock the dependencies as object to satisfy the constructor.

I will submit a test that uses reflection to invoke PerformAsync and verifies the logger calls, focusing on the LogInformation call on line 67.

